sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Customer
  participant S as Storefront
  participant A as Order API
  participant P as Payment provider

  U->>S: Checkout cart
  S->>A: POST /orders
  A-->>S: 201 Created (order_id)
  S->>P: Create payment intent
  alt payment succeeded
    P-->>S: success
    S->>A: PATCH /orders/{id} status=paid
    S-->>U: Order confirmation
  else payment failed
    P-->>S: declined
    S-->>U: Ask for another card
  end
  Note over A,P: Webhook keeps order and payment in sync
